dden\">\n          <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center space-y-8\">\n              <blockquote class=\"text-lg font-medium mb-6\" aria-label=\"Quote from Tom Johnson\">\u201cLorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed vel commodo erat.\u201d</blockquote>\n              <p class=\"font-body text-white mb-6\" aria-label=\"Author Name Tom Johnson\">By Tom Johnson</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- SLIDE CONTROLS -->\n      <button class=\"carousel__btn absolute top-0 left-0 z-10 w-full h-full\" aria-label=\"Carousel Prev\">Previous</button>\n      <button class=\"carousel__btn absolute top-0 right-0 z-10 w-full h-full\" aria-label=\"Carousel Next\">Next</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section>\n  <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-primary\">Order now</h1>\n  <nav>\n    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Home\">Home</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"About us\">About us</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a>\n  </nav>\n  <main class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8\">\n    <article class=\"glass-card text-white bg-transparent hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n      <h2>Our burgers</h2>\n      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam ac velit vel nibh interdum ultrices.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"glass-card text-white bg-transparent hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n      <h2>Our fries</h2>\n      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam ac velit vel nibh interdum ultrices.</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"glass-card text-white bg-transparent hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n      <h2>Our drinks</h2>\n      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nullam ac velit vel nibh interdum ultrices.</p>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n  <footer class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-primary to-secondary text-white py-8\">\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Phone\">Phone</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Email\">Email</a>\n    </nav>\n  </footer>\n</section>\n\n\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">What are your hours of operation?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">We are open from 11am to 9pm, Monday through Sunday.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">Do you offer vegetarian options?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a variety of vegetarian burgers and sides available.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">Can I customize my burger?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Absolutely! You can choose from a variety of toppings and sauces to make your burger just the way you like it.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">What kind of burgers do you serve?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">We offer classic beef burgers, as well as turkey, chicken, and even vegan options. Our burgers are made with fresh, high-quality ingredients.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">Do you have any deals or promotions?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, we often have